{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2019-07", "window": 1, "start_date": 1561939200, "end_date": 1562543999, "month_true_total": 149, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:57:10 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "53948903", "author": {"steamid": "76561198091337599", "personaname": "Odie Morningstar", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198091337599/", "num_games_owned": 1157, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 885, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 338, "last_played": 1725841791, "avatar": "3ee96844626a8428d4129773a26d97bbef457c43"}, "language": "english", "review": "Whether you're someone who is really into the world of Warhammer 40,000 or are someone who doesn't know what an Ultramarine is but really like visceral shooters, then you'll love this game. In Warhammer 40K: Space Marine, you're only here for the gameplay, to purge the bastard Orks that are stealing your ancient war machines by any means necessary. \n\nIf you're a fan of 40K, then you might get some enjoyment out of the story. I played this game knowing next to nothing of 40K lore but still enjoyed every moment of this game. After adjusting some settings, controlling your character feels great in his massive power armour. Combine that with the unique weapons this world has to offer and you'll have a blast. \n\nYour weapons range from your usual pistol and assault rifle (in game known as bolters), to fire spewing shotguns, mine launchers powered by vengeance, and a jump-pack and giant f**k off, thunder hammer combo just to name a few.\n\nGame should take you 5 hours to complete but ever minute is just pure fun. Wait until it's on sale cause €20 is a bit steep.", "timestamp_created": 1562540156, "timestamp_updated": 1562540279, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.544072985649108887", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "r